WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:09.742
♪ ♪

00:00:09.775 --> 00:00:11.444
- GIVE YOURSELF UP, CARLO.

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:13.046
- [echoing spookily]
WHY WOULD I DO THAT,

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:16.616
DETECTIVE,
WHEN I HAVE THE UPPER HAND?

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:19.586
[laughing evilly]

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:31.230
- GIVE YOURSELF UP, CARLO.

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:32.832
- I'M RIGHT HERE,
DETECTIVE.

00:00:32.865 --> 00:00:35.735
[laughing evilly]

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:37.303
- DAMN IT.
[gasps]

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:40.740
- OR AM I OVER HERE,
DETECTIVE?

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:41.741
- [yells]

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:49.783
♪ ♪

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.619
- OR HERE?

00:00:53.652 --> 00:00:55.221
[laughing evilly]

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:56.255
- [panting]

00:00:56.288 --> 00:00:58.524
OH, YOU SICK SON OF A BITCH,

00:00:58.557 --> 00:01:00.093
WHERE THE HELL ARE YOU?

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:02.495
HUH?

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.265
[gasps]

00:01:06.298 --> 00:01:07.733
HUH?

00:01:07.766 --> 00:01:09.735
YOU SON OF A BITCH,
COME OUT!

00:01:09.768 --> 00:01:12.371
- DOES MY ASS LOOK BIG
IN THIS JUMPSUIT?

00:01:12.404 --> 00:01:13.873
[laughing evilly]

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:14.874
- DAMN IT.

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:17.877
[music intensifying]

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.113
♪ ♪

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.215
ENOUGH OF THE GAMES, CARLO.

00:01:25.584 --> 00:01:28.754
- THE GAMES ARE JUST BEGINNING,
DETECTIVE.

00:01:28.787 --> 00:01:31.724
[laughing evilly]

00:01:35.394 --> 00:01:39.232
MIRROR, MIRROR,
ON THE WALL...

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:41.567
[chuckles]

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:44.237
WHO'S THE FAIREST OF THEM--

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.538
WHOA, WHOA, WHOA.

00:01:45.571 --> 00:01:47.707
- DON'T MOVE.

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:53.179
YOU ARE UNDER ARREST
FOR THE MURDER OF MARY DEELY,

00:01:53.212 --> 00:01:55.148
MEG FOSTER,

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:59.886
AND ONE DETECTIVE
MASON JIMENEZ.

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:02.155
NOW, WHERE'S THE GIRL?

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:06.692
- OH, DETECTIVE,
YOU ASSUME IT'S THE REAL ME

00:02:06.725 --> 00:02:08.794
STANDING IN FRONT OF YOU,

00:02:08.827 --> 00:02:11.164
BUT MAYBE THAT'S JUST WHAT

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:14.300
I WANT YOU TO THIN-K.

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:15.301
WHEN IN REALITY,

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:17.470
THE RE-AL ME

00:02:17.503 --> 00:02:20.740
IS SAFE IN A HIDING SPAH-AH--
AH-AH.

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:25.211
- OKAY, THAT'S THE REAL YOU,
ALL RIGHT.

00:02:25.244 --> 00:02:26.746
- OR MAYBE I'M OVER HERE.

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:28.381
- NO, NO,
YOU'RE NOT OVER THERE.

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:30.349
CARLO, I'M ONLY GONNA
ASK YOU ONE MORE TIME.

00:02:30.382 --> 00:02:31.150
WHERE IS THE GIRL?

00:02:31.183 --> 00:02:33.486
- GO AHEAD AND SHOOT,
DETECTIVE.

00:02:33.519 --> 00:02:34.687
[chuckles]

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:37.490
I MEAN, WHAT DO I CARE IF YOU
GET SEVEN YEARS BAD LUCK--

00:02:37.523 --> 00:02:39.258
[gun cocks]
OKAY.

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:40.726
YOU KNOW, IT'S NOT SAFE
TO KEEP A GUN COCKED LIKE THAT,

00:02:40.759 --> 00:02:43.429
EVEN IF YOU ARE JUST
POINTING IT AT A MIRROR.

00:02:43.462 --> 00:02:47.567
- TURN AROUND AND PUT
YOUR HANDS ON YOUR HEAD.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.835
- NOW, FOR THAT,
YOU REALLY ARE GOING TO HAVE

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:50.669
TO FIND THE REAL ME.

00:02:50.702 --> 00:02:52.305
- OH, MY GOD,
ARE YOU KIDDING ME?

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:54.974
[gunshot]
- [groaning]

00:02:55.007 --> 00:02:55.975
PSHHT!

00:02:56.008 --> 00:02:57.276
- WHAT?

00:02:57.309 --> 00:02:58.778
- WHY WOULD YOU SHOOT
A MIRROR?

00:02:58.811 --> 00:02:59.812
- CARLO, IT'S YOU.

00:02:59.845 --> 00:03:01.847
I'M HOLDING YOUR LAPEL.

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:03.983
NOW, YOU'RE DONE.
IT'S OVER.

00:03:04.016 --> 00:03:06.452
- YOU'RE GONNA CUT YOUR HAND
ON THAT BROKEN MIRROR.

00:03:06.485 --> 00:03:08.254
[gun cocks]
- WHERE IS SHE?

00:03:08.287 --> 00:03:10.289
- JUST SAY IT, DUDE.

00:03:10.322 --> 00:03:11.490
- SAY WHAT?

00:03:11.523 --> 00:03:12.658
- SAY YOU DON'T KNOW
WHETHER OR NOT

00:03:12.691 --> 00:03:15.761
THIS IS THE REAL ME OR JUST
A REFLECTION IN A MIRROR.

00:03:15.794 --> 00:03:17.430
- REALLY?

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:20.333
- I'LL TELL YOU WHERE SHE IS.

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:22.702
- OKAY, I DON'T KNOW
WHETHER THE YOU

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:24.604
I'M HOLDING ON TO
IS REALLY YOU...

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:25.838
- OR THE REFLECTION
IN A MIRROR.

00:03:25.871 --> 00:03:27.540
- OR A REFLECTION
IN THE MIRROR.

00:03:27.573 --> 00:03:29.475
- MM, ALL THERE WAS TO IT.

00:03:29.508 --> 00:03:31.644
SHE'S UNDER THE FLOORBOARDS
BY THE ENTRANCE.

00:03:31.677 --> 00:03:34.914
OH.
[groaning]

00:03:34.947 --> 00:03:36.983
I WIN, DETECTIVE.

00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:38.017
[laughing bleakly]

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:40.853
I TOLD YOU, BUT--
I MEAN, THE MIRROR TOLD YOU,

00:03:40.886 --> 00:03:42.788
BUT, WELL, YOU KNOW.

00:03:42.821 --> 00:03:44.324
OH, FUCK.

